{#- Driver details in advance: a link to the client's OWN Google Form (licence, age, DVLA check code) and the check code
    rule from gov.uk with the date we checked it. The site never stores, checks or decides anything. -#}
{%- if "driver-form" | enabled %}{% set df = site.hire.driverForm %}
<div class="hr-df"{{ "driver-form" | tierAttr | safe }}>
  <h3 class="hr-df-h">Send your driver details before the day</h3>
  <p>Your licence, date of birth and a DVLA check code, on our own form. We check them before the handover; this site doesn't keep or check anything.</p>
  <p class="hr-df-code">A check code lasts {{ df.checkCode.validDays | words }} days, so make it close to your hire: <a href="{{ df.checkCode.source }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">get one on gov.uk</a> <small>(checked {{ df.checkCode.checked | longDate }})</small>.</p>
  <a class="dt-go" href="{{ df.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the driver details form</a>
</div>
{%- endif %}
